    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Debola ni Balaki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵawile Ehudi, ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵatesile soni ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵamkundile Yabini, mwenye jwa Akenani juŵalamulilaga msinda wa Hasoli kuti ŵapunde jemanjajo. Jwakulamulila jwa ngondo jwakwe ŵaliji Sisela juŵatamaga ku Halosheti kwa ŵa mitundu jine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabini ŵakwete mageleta ga yisyano ya ayiloni 900, nipo ŵalamulilaga ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli mwa ngalwe ni kwatamika mpela acikapolo kwa yaka makumi gaŵili. Kaneko ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵalisile kwa AMBUJE kuti ŵakamucisye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Debola, msonogwawo Lapidoti, ŵaliji jwakulocesya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ŵatumicilaga mpela jwakwelusya Aisalaeli jele ndaŵijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanonyelaga kutama pasi pa citela cine ca mgwalangwa pasikati pa Lama ni Beteli mcilambo ca kwitumbi ca Efelemu, nipo ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵajawulaga kweleko kuti jwalakwe akakamusye nganisyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line jwalakwe ŵamŵilasisye Balaki mwanace jwa Abinowamu kutyocela ku msinda wa Kedeshi ku Nafutali ni ŵamsalile jwalakwe kuti, “AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, ampele m'mwejo lilamusi ali: ‘Mwajigale acalume 10,000 kutyocela ku ngosyo sya Nafutali ni Sebuloni ni kwalongolela jemanjajo Kwitumbi lya Taboli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une tinjimŵilasya Sisela, jwakulamulila ŵa ngondo ŵa Yabini, kuti amenyane ni jemanja pa Lusulo lwa Kishoni. Jwalakwe tacijigala mageleta gakwe ni asilikali ŵakwe, nambo une tinjimpundisya ni kwapunda jemanjajo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Balaki ŵajanjile kuti, “Tinjijawula naga akwawula ni une, nambo naga ngakwawula ni une, none jwakwe ngisinjawula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵajitice kuti, “Cambone, tinjijawula ni m'mwejo, nambotu m'mwejo ngasimkola ucimbicimbi uliwose pa kwele kupundako, ligongo AMBUJE tacimpeleka Sisela kwa jwamkongwe.” Myoyo Debola ŵanyakwice ulendo wakwawula ku Kedeshi pamo ni Balaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki ŵasiŵilasile ngosyo sya Sebuloni ni Nafutali ku Kedeshi, nipo acalume wakwana 10,000 ŵamkuyisye jwalakwejo. Debola nombe najo ŵalongene ni Balaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu jele ndaŵiji Hebele jwa mtundu wa Akeni ŵaliji ali ataŵile tenti jakwe kuŵandicila ku Kedeshi ciŵandika ni citela ca mtundu ku Sananimu. Jwalakwe ŵaliji ali asamile kutyoka kwa Akeni acimjakwe, yisukulu ya Hobabu, mlambagwawo Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisela piŵapikene kuti Balaki mwanace jwa Abinowamu akwesile Kwitumbi lya Taboli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵaŵilasisye mageleta gakwe ga yisyano ya ayiloni 900 ni acalume ŵakwe wosope, ni ŵatumisye kutyocela ku Halosheti kwa ŵa mitundu jine kwawula ku Lusulo lwa Kishoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Debola ŵatite kwa Balaki, “Jawulani! AMBUJE akumlongolela m'mwejo! Lelo jino jwalakwe ampundisye m'mwejo pakumpeleka Sisela m'myala mwenu.” Ni Balaki ŵatulwice mwitumbi lya Taboli ni acalume ŵakwe 10,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki ni asilikali ŵakwe piŵajitandite ngondo, AMBUJE ŵamsyungwisye mtwe Sisela pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe wosope ni mageleta gakwe. Sisela ŵatulwice pa ligeleta lyakwe ni ŵatisile ni sajo syawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki ŵagatopwesye mageletago ni asilikaliwo mpaka ku Halosheti kwa ŵa mitundu jine, nipo ŵa ngondo wosope ŵa Sisela ŵawulajidwe. Pangali mundu jumo juŵamlesile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisela ŵawutucile ku tenti ja Yaeli, jwamkongwe jwa Hebele jwa mtundu wa Akeni, ligongo paliji pana mtendele pasikati pa Mwenye Yabini jwa Hasoli ni liŵasa lya Hebele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaeli ŵakopwece pasa kuwonegana ni Sisela ni ŵatite kwa jwalakwe, “Ajinjile, bwana, ajinjile mu tenti mwangu. Akajogopa.” Ni jwalakwe ŵajinjile, ni ŵamsisile kusyeto kwa likatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵatite kwa jwamkongwejo, “Conde ambe mesi gakumwa, jingwete njota.” Jwamkongwejo ŵawugwile msaku wa lipende wa mkaka, ŵampele kumwa, ni ŵamsisile soni kaŵili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵamsalile jwamkongwejo kuti, “Mjime pa mlango wa tenti, nipo naga jwalijose akwisa ni kumwusya naga kwana mundu jwine akuno, mjile iyayi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisela ŵapesile mnope mwakuti ŵagonile lugono. Kaneko Yaeli ŵajigele nyundo ni cicili ca tenti, kaneko ŵamjawulile jwalakwejo mwakumgwaŵilila, ni kumwulaga pakumkomela cicilico pa mbali ja mtwe wakwe mpaka kubowola ni kwinjila pasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki piŵayice kukumlolesya Sisela, Yaeli ŵakopwece kukuwonegana najo ni ŵatite kwa jwalakwe, “Ayice akuno! Une tinalosye mundu jwakumlolesyajo.” Ni jwalakwe ŵajinjile ni jwamkongwejo, nipo alole, Sisela ŵaliji ali agonile pasi jwam'we, ni cicili ca tenti cili cipowele mtwe wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
